Note: ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Note:  main.epl — EPLAI Discord Bot Entry Point
Note:
Note:  100% written in EPL — no Python bridge, no external libs
Note:  Uses: EPL WebSocket (gateway), EPL HTTP (Groq + Discord REST),
Note:        EPL SQLite (memory), EPL Threading (heartbeat loop)
Note:
Note:  Free AI: Groq LLaMA 3 70B (300+ tokens/sec, no cost)
Note:  Free Search: DuckDuckGo Instant API (no key required)
Note:
Note:  To run:
Note:    Set-Item Env:DISCORD_TOKEN "your_discord_token"
Note:    Set-Item Env:GROQ_API_KEY  "your_groq_api_key"
Note:    epl main.epl
Note: ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Import "memory.epl"
Import "tools.epl"
Import "agent.epl"
Import "gateway.epl"

Note: ── Startup Banner ──
Say "╔══════════════════════════════════════════════╗"
Say "║      EPLAI Discord Agent v1.0                ║"
Say "║  Built 100% in EPL — English Prog. Language  ║"
Say "║  LLM: Groq LLaMA 3 70B (Free, 300+ tok/s)   ║"
Say "║  Memory: SQLite  |  Search: DuckDuckGo Free  ║"
Say "╚══════════════════════════════════════════════╝"
Say ""

Note: ── Environment Variable Checks ──
Create discord_token equal to env_get("DISCORD_TOKEN")
Create groq_api_key equal to env_get("GROQ_API_KEY")

If discord_token is equal to Nothing then
    Say "❌ ERROR: DISCORD_TOKEN environment variable is not set."
    Say "   Run: Set-Item Env:DISCORD_TOKEN 'your_bot_token'"
    exit_code(1)
End

If groq_api_key is equal to Nothing then
    Say "❌ ERROR: GROQ_API_KEY environment variable is not set."
    Say "   Get a free key at: https://console.groq.com"
    Say "   Run: Set-Item Env:GROQ_API_KEY 'your_groq_api_key'"
    exit_code(1)
End

Say "✅ DISCORD_TOKEN loaded."
Say "✅ GROQ_API_KEY loaded."

Note: ── Initialize Persistent Memory ──
Say "[Memory] Opening database: agent_memory.db"
Create db equal to real_db_open("agent_memory.db")
memory_setup(db)
Say "[Memory] ✅ Database ready."
Say ""

Note: ── Launch Gateway Connection ──
Say "[Bot] Connecting to Discord Gateway using EPL native WebSocket..."
Say "[Bot] Using EPL's net_ws_connect — no Python bridge."
Say ""

gateway_run(discord_token, db, groq_api_key)
